<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait Petroleum Corp says 95/6 profit up 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Kuwait Petroleum Corp says 95/6 profit up 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Oil Minister Abdul-Mohsen al-Mudej said on Tuesday Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) profit rose 7.1 percent to 869 million dinars ($2.9 billion) in 1995/96 (June-July), the official Kuwait News Agency said.</p>
<p>Citing unaudited figures Mudej told a news conference KPC, which runs the oil sector, made &quot;record profits amounting to 869 million dinars. It made a profit of 811 million in 1994/95.&quot;</p>
<p>The agency said Mudej, who also heads KPC, attributed the profit rise to an increase in profits from operations.</p>
</text>
